  "conventions": {
    "foundation_first": "frontend-foundation always precedes premium-frontend-design, product-tour, forms-and-validation, landing-page-architect",
    "data_before_auth": "database-architect precedes auth-architect (auth needs user/session tables)",
    "domain_before_architecture": "domain-modeler precedes hexagonal-architect/api-architect",
    "polish_last": "premium-frontend-design is polish — run after product-ux-advisor and frontend-foundation",
    "security_pre_ship": "infra-security runs before any production deploy",
    "sdd_for_substantial_changes": "sdd-workflow activates on triggers (sdd new, sdd ff, etc.) or when changes touch ≥ 3 files / architecture",
    "performance_audit_after_frontend": "react-performance runs as a non-destructive review gate after any frontend implementation skill (frontend-foundation, premium-frontend-design, forms-and-validation, product-tour, landing-page-architect) produces React code. Conditional: new components, useEffect, data fetching, render loops, or > 2 components touched. Skip on trivial edits, copy changes, or style-only tweaks.",
    "performance_audit_after_backend": "backend-performance runs as a non-destructive review gate after any backend implementation skill (api-architect, hexagonal-architect, database-architect, auth-architect) produces code. Conditional: new endpoint/handler, new DB query, async/IO work, loop with awaits, large payload, or > 2 backend files touched. Skip on trivial edits, config changes, or doc-only tweaks.",
    "design_audit_after_frontend": "frontend-output-validator runs as a non-destructive review gate after any frontend implementation skill (frontend-foundation, premium-frontend-design, forms-and-validation, product-tour, landing-page-architect) produces UI. Reads project DESIGN.md as source of truth. Checks: WCAG contrast, CLS sources, icon budget per region, touch targets ≥ 44px, viewport meta, mobile-first compliance, forbidden AI Tells (Pure Black, LILA BAN, Inter Tell, Icon Soup, Mobile Afterthought, Layout Shift Sloppy, Filler Word Index, Jane Doe Effect, Acme Slop). Conditional: new components, new images/videos/fonts/icons, > 1 component touched, hover/focus/active states modified. Skip on copy-only or type-only changes.",
    "design_contract_per_project": "Every project ships a DESIGN.md at repo root combining YAML tokens (breakpoints, colors, typography, spacing, motion, iconBudget, contentPriority, aiTellsEnforced) with markdown rationale. Format borrows from Google Labs DESIGN.md (https://github.com/google-labs-code/design.md) and extends with Dublin specifics. Agent reads it at start of every session. CI validates with scripts/validate-design.ts.",
    "change_safety_pre_write": "change-safety runs BEFORE any production write. Auto-invokes on signals: ALTER/DROP/TRUNCATE/RENAME, UPDATE/DELETE without WHERE, mass batch updates, deploy to prod, store/CMS catalog or pricing or inventory edit, env/secret rotation, DNS change, TLS swap, IAM/security group change, infra parameter change. Forces snapshot, rollback plan, stakeholder comms, in-flight transaction check, change window, approval gate. Pairs with database-architect (zero-downtime migrations), github-safety (non-destructive git), infra-security (audits).",
    "git_workflow_team_setup": "git-workflow is the constructive counterpart of github-safety (defensive). Use it for team setup: produces CONTRIBUTING.md, PR template, husky hooks (pre-commit/commit-msg/pre-push), commitlint config, .gitmessage, CODEOWNERS, branch protection script, CI workflow. Enforcement runs LOCAL via git hooks and GitHub branch protection — zero LLM tokens at runtime. Skill invoked only on-demand (setup, audit, conflict help). 4 named AI Tells: Garbage Commit, Frankenstein PR, Eternal Branch, History Bomb."
  }
}
